[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21901400_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21901400_03_0010","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21901400_03_0020","text":"差不多到时间了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21901400_03_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21901400_03_0030","text":"没问题的，练了那么多\n一定能发挥得很好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21901400_03_0040","text":"嗯，我也是这么觉得的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21901400_03_0050","text":"因为练到自己完全满意为止了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21901400_03_0060","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21901400_03_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21901400_03_0070","text":"好，差不多该上场了\n把努力的成果，尽情展现出来吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21901400_03_0080","text":"粉丝们也好，我也好\n都准备好要嗨起来了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21901400_03_0090","text":"嗯\n谢啦，制作人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21901400_03_0100","text":"……我出发了！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21901400_03_0101","text":"Motion"}]
